# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, profile "dedicated" on BACKEND=vulkan: read before dedicated.env, which supplies
# the rest. Every expert in RAM: on the RX 570 nine expert layers on the card bought 9 % and more
# bought nothing, and at 131k this leaves ~2 GB of VRAM free (6 026 MiB used). The window stays at
# 131k: measured at 22.4-22.8 tok/s on each of three requests on one cache. See
# docs/qwen36.md#on-the-rx-570-vulkan.
: "${CPU_MOE:=40}"
